@startuml sequence_diagram
actor User as U
participant "Next.js Frontend" as UI
participant "Vapi SDK" as V
participant "Vapi Cloud / LLM" as A
database "MongoDB" as DB

U -> UI: Clicks "Start Call"
UI -> DB: Fetch Book Segments
DB -->> UI: Return Content Chunks
UI -> V: vapi.start(config + book context)
V -> A: Establish WebRTC Connection
A -->> V: Connected
U -> V: Speaks into Microphone
V -> A: Audio Stream
note right of A: Transcribes, queries LLM, synthesizes TTS
A -->> V: Return AI Audio Stream & Transcript
V -->> UI: Update Transcript State
V -->> U: Plays AI Voice
@enduml